### ❌ `N8N-BE-203` — Zero Unreachable Orphan Nodes [CRITICAL]
**Issue**: Every non-trigger node in the workflow graph must have at least one incoming connection from another node.
**Fix**: Zero nodes where `node.name` is absent from all target arrays in the `connections` object (excluding nodes with `type.includes('trigger')` or `type.includes('webhook')`).
```diff
- A node `"Orphan Slack Fallback Node"` defined in `nodes[]` that is never targeted by any parent node in `connections`.
+ [Compliant fix]
```

**Corrected code:**
```
{
  "name": "Orphan Workflow",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [
        100,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orphan Node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [
        300,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Orphan Node",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
